# Quarto / Markdown content

- Prefer clear headings, short paragraphs, and tables for alignment maps.
- Course-facing language: English.
- Link to KI and external resources instead of pasting long third-party text.
- Follow [`.agents/skills/plain-prose/SKILL.md`](../../.agents/skills/plain-prose/SKILL.md) (D024).
- Keep examples free of real personal data.
- When changing pedagogical commitments or tooling defaults, add a `DECISIONS.md` entry.
- Render check (when Quarto is available): `quarto render plan/session-master.qmd`
- [`plan/session-master.qmd`](../../plan/session-master.qmd) is the teacher master (D052 / D053); aim for about three pages
